[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16200.97, "timestamp": "04:30:00", "text": "学会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16202.429, "timestamp": "04:30:02", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16205.349, "timestamp": "04:30:05", "text": "确实如此，但我不知道我不知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16207.87, "timestamp": "04:30:07", "text": "这样做的方法"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16210.87, "timestamp": "04:30:10", "text": "它。是的，我需要考虑的因素太多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16212.269, "timestamp": "04:30:12", "text": "要留心"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16218.75, "timestamp": "04:30:18", "text": "那太疯狂了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16222.07, "timestamp": "04:30:22", "text": "现在。我还是，我还是星巴克，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16225.389, "timestamp": "04:30:25", "text": "现在，兄弟。我仍然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16228.55, "timestamp": "04:30:28", "text": "斯塔拉克。兄弟，这也太疯狂了吧。是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16232.469, "timestamp": "04:30:32", "text": "比如，“哇。”我们待了大概两个小时，不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16234.55, "timestamp": "04:30:34", "text": "大概20到30分钟吧。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16236.07, "timestamp": "04:30:36", "text": "不知道是不是30分钟，但我们有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16238.55, "timestamp": "04:30:38", "text": "他待了一会儿，就已经"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16249.59, "timestamp": "04:30:49", "text": "疯狂的。太疯狂了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16252.149, "timestamp": "04:30:52", "text": "我觉得他做的事情会是这样的："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16255.429, "timestamp": "04:30:55", "text": "我本该猜测并思考他会怎么做。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16256.127, "timestamp": "04:30:56", "author": "@bakononcopiumm", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/hb5sPAHLUD7fBrZZsmfkzISQWwRqI8BY1n8lceyhZz0sNISomD05pCwUe-GL2amD5y-voH_uYw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "sup joq dude"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16259.51, "timestamp": "04:30:59", "text": "就像他用 OBS 的时候一样"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16259.929, "timestamp": "04:30:59", "author": "@bakononcopiumm", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/hb5sPAHLUD7fBrZZsmfkzISQWw